{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Minimalist Arcade Action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Riskers</strong> is a minimalist arcade action game built around speed, precision, and player skill. Each session drops you into a fast-moving challenge where survival depends entirely on your reactions and timing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no complex systems to learn \u2014 just immediate, demanding gameplay that rewards mastery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fast, High-Risk Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay in Riskers is designed to be intense and unforgiving. Mistakes are punished quickly, encouraging players to learn patterns, improve reflexes, and push for higher scores with each attempt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs are short and repeatable, making the game ideal for quick sessions or extended score-chasing marathons.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Clean Visuals, Pure Focus</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The minimalist presentation keeps the focus entirely on gameplay. Clean visuals and simple effects ensure clarity even at high speeds, reinforcing the game\u2019s arcade roots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Riskers is a <strong>single-player experience</strong> aimed at players who enjoy challenging reflex games and classic arcade design.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist arcade action gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, reflex-driven challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score-focused design built for replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short sessions with escalating difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean visuals emphasizing gameplay clarity</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player arcade experience</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Saving Bullets","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/581310/4f2087a43b8b7b23fd9e5ac384bd87df